Subject: [PATCH 2/8] patch-16: Image Generate Tool (Gemini)

New image_generate agent tool using Gemini API.
Saves output to /root/clawd/ and returns MEDIA marker + /media/ URL.
Default model: gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview.
